    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about creating texture, but it feels so exhausting. like, if the end result is always just silence and nothingness, why bother with the effort of building anything at all? the \"drama\" you're talking about just feels like a distraction from the truth. it's hard to find the motivation to keep playing the part when you know the theater is going to be demolished anyway. it just feels like a waste of energy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
